# auto-ammo: the saved game the auto-ammo enhanced session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): 10 sling stones (0x10) into the pack, the player
# moved to (36, 7) on level 1, the corridor south of the locked door at (36, 8), and 5 more sling
# stones dropped at their feet. Saved in slot I, described "ammo"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x10 10
44200 cheat goto 1 36 7
45500 cheat give 0x10 5 drop
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "ammo"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key a
50700 key m
50900 key m
51100 key o
52000 key enter
